'''Go to Hell!''' (ゴートゥーヘル！, ''Gō Tū Heru!'', '''Go to Hell!''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Weaken" Effect UP (L): Weaken duration increases by 30%.

